Practice

Write a program that ensures the user enters a number between 1 and 100. The loop should continue asking until the user enters -1 to quit.


num = int(input(“Enter a number between 1 and 100 (-1 to quit):”))
while num != -1:
if 1 &lt;= num &lt;= 100:
print(“Valid number:”, num)
else:
print(“Out of range! Try again.”)
num = int(input(“Enter a number between 1 and 100 (-1 to quit):”))
print(“Exiting program.”)

